sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Manager as "Manager/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (manager.shift-swap-approvals.show/index)"
    participant Controller as "ShiftSwapApprovalController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Manager->>View: Isi alasan lalu klik Tolak
    View->>Controller: POST /manager/shift-swap-approvals/{id}/reject + reason
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi reason wajib
    Controller->>Model: Ambil swap request by id
    Model->>DB: SELECT shift_swap_requests WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>Model: Data swap request

    alt Data valid (reason terisi & status dapat ditolak)
        Controller->>Model: Proses rejectByManager(id, manager_id, reason)
        Model->>DB: UPDATE shift_swap_requests\nSET status='rejected', manager_id=?
        DB-->>Model: Update success
        Model-->>Controller: Rejected
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Manager: Notifikasi berhasil menolak
    else Data tidak valid (reason kosong/id tidak ada/status tidak sesuai)
        Controller->>View: Back + error/validation
        View-->>Manager: Notifikasi gagal menolak
    end
